WEBVTT

00:00:23.838 --> 00:00:26.878
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.269
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:33.524
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.569 --> 00:00:35.896
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.673 --> 00:00:48.649
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.645
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.697 --> 00:00:55.191
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.772 --> 00:00:58.408
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.409 --> 00:01:00.559
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.818
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.848 --> 00:01:07.980
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:12.299
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.311 --> 00:01:14.611
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.188 --> 00:01:19.325
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.351 --> 00:01:21.751
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.752 --> 00:01:24.800
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.424
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.425 --> 00:01:29.019
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:31.538
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:34.660
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.738 --> 00:01:37.206
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:39.090
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.091 --> 00:01:40.624
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:40.972 --> 00:01:44.663
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.908 --> 00:01:49.876
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:53.344
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:05.069 --> 00:02:07.375
You're served by servants every day.

00:02:07.409 --> 00:02:11.398
You're in such fine shape.
I'm sure your blood taste good.

00:02:12.949 --> 00:02:14.496
You're a mage, right?

00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:16.516
Why do you have no guts?

00:02:16.891 --> 00:02:17.891
Look at them.

00:02:17.984 --> 00:02:19.588
At least they can still scream.

00:02:19.628 --> 00:02:20.747
We meet again.

00:02:25.292 --> 00:02:26.718
I had a hard time looking for you.

00:02:30.435 --> 00:02:31.904
You again?

00:02:32.062 --> 00:02:33.571
You can't escape this time.

00:02:33.645 --> 00:02:34.714
Little child.

00:02:34.715 --> 00:02:36.614
Don't act rashly.

00:02:36.861 --> 00:02:39.848
I'm in the body of an innocent girl.

00:02:39.928 --> 00:02:43.387
I won't show any mercy.
and let you harm other people.

00:02:45.244 --> 00:02:47.884
Do you think you can stop me?

00:02:49.069 --> 00:02:50.095
Try me then.

00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:51.315
Fine!

00:02:51.442 --> 00:02:54.653
I'll kill you first!
And take revenge for my husband!

00:02:56.536 --> 00:02:57.403
Bone Shield!

00:03:08.986 --> 00:03:09.759
It is bad!

00:03:11.563 --> 00:03:12.296
Damn it!

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.372
She's a Warrior-level monster now.

00:03:14.872 --> 00:03:18.390
If not, she couldn't have break
my Bone Shield in just a few hits.

00:03:19.893 --> 00:03:20.813
Die!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.676
Die!

00:03:22.723 --> 00:03:23.984
Shadow Shift, Shuttle!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:34.720
Are you okay?

00:03:35.456 --> 00:03:37.429
Don't worry about me.

00:03:38.797 --> 00:03:39.837
I will distract her.

00:03:40.003 --> 00:03:43.352
Please ask the lighting technician
to focus all the lights on one spot.

00:03:44.428 --> 00:03:45.095
Okay.

00:03:52.442 --> 00:03:54.175
Hiss of Fire, Burn!

00:04:09.294 --> 00:04:11.520
Her scales are very strong.

00:04:11.903 --> 00:04:14.050
My magic should've caused
some damage to her.

00:04:14.244 --> 00:04:16.625
Even if it's a high-level fire magic,

00:04:16.784 --> 00:04:18.850
it can't destroy her scales.

00:04:19.212 --> 00:04:21.170
Fire Burst, Cremation!

00:04:28.855 --> 00:04:30.282
Hiss of Fire, Explode!

00:04:54.018 --> 00:04:55.525
This is really troublesome.

00:05:17.747 --> 00:05:19.581
You guys again?
It will end.

00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:34.943
Get away from here!

00:05:36.163 --> 00:05:38.123
The Scaly Queen is too fast.

00:05:38.238 --> 00:05:40.211
I've used the Boots
of the Beast already.

00:05:40.313 --> 00:05:42.673
I can't use it without
replenishing my mana.

00:05:43.059 --> 00:05:44.952
My Bone Shield is no match for her.

00:05:44.981 --> 00:05:47.867
Shadow Shift is
my only protective magic now.

00:05:48.557 --> 00:05:50.530
But not every place has shadows.

00:05:51.263 --> 00:05:51.983
What should I do?

00:05:53.388 --> 00:05:55.494
Thank goodness!
I can contact you again!

00:05:56.387 --> 00:05:57.975
Mo Fan, are you okay?

00:05:58.664 --> 00:06:00.105
Don't worry. I'm not dead yet.

00:06:00.558 --> 00:06:02.251
She had evolved
into a Warrior-level monster.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:13.457
I'm surrounded!

00:06:14.215 --> 00:06:15.215
Use Fire Magic!

00:06:15.893 --> 00:06:17.613
Fiery Fist is strong,

00:06:17.653 --> 00:06:19.588
but their numbers are too large!

00:06:22.158 --> 00:06:24.344
This is my nest now.

00:06:24.373 --> 00:06:26.439
I can kill you easily.

00:06:27.418 --> 00:06:28.085
Mo Fan.

00:06:28.098 --> 00:06:30.066
There's no other entrance here.

00:06:30.363 --> 00:06:31.243
This is a crisis!

00:06:31.342 --> 00:06:32.845
And the Hunters are going
to confront them head on!

00:06:33.332 --> 00:06:35.460
We can't save those
who are infected now!

00:06:35.777 --> 00:06:37.177
If not, there'll be more casualties!

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.352
You alone find ways to run away!

00:06:39.546 --> 00:06:40.226
Fast!

00:06:44.002 --> 00:06:44.879
Save me!

00:06:45.124 --> 00:06:46.097
Please!

00:06:47.359 --> 00:06:49.007
If the Hunters come in,
they'll be alerted.

00:06:49.401 --> 00:06:52.239
And all the girls
that are infected will die!

00:06:52.733 --> 00:06:55.160
It's better than letting them
build their nest in the stadium.

00:06:55.866 --> 00:06:57.933
You can't kill the Scaly Queen.

00:06:58.743 --> 00:07:00.747
Who are you?
Are you the one making decisions?

00:07:00.748 --> 00:07:03.377
I don't care who you are!
You have no right to sacrifice them!

00:07:04.164 --> 00:07:06.817
This is not the time to be a hero!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.433
No matter what,

00:07:10.318 --> 00:07:13.023
I believe that anyone
facing the same situation...

00:07:13.311 --> 00:07:15.537
would try to save
as many people as they can too.

00:07:16.816 --> 00:07:17.815
Give me some time!

00:07:18.867 --> 00:07:19.827
You can't kill it!

00:07:20.032 --> 00:07:22.706
It's a Warrior-level monster!
It's impossible for you!

00:07:22.799 --> 00:07:24.359
We're at the entrance now!

00:07:26.461 --> 00:07:27.061
Damn it!

00:07:27.087 --> 00:07:29.006
Just give me some time!
Didn't you hear that?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:30.637
You...

00:07:30.974 --> 00:07:32.387
Give him some time.

00:07:32.783 --> 00:07:33.512
But...

00:07:33.752 --> 00:07:36.006
They have the right to live too.

00:07:48.552 --> 00:07:50.461
You're not the only one
with friends here.

00:08:20.412 --> 00:08:22.935
Rip him apart!

00:08:48.507 --> 00:08:49.613
It's done!

00:08:52.707 --> 00:08:53.387
Go!

00:09:24.226 --> 00:09:26.495
Help me fend off these monsters. Thanks!

00:09:27.508 --> 00:09:28.454
Damned monster!

00:09:28.541 --> 00:09:31.381
If I don't kill you today,
I will change my name!

00:09:34.117 --> 00:09:35.370
Shadow Shift, Shuttle!

00:09:37.466 --> 00:09:38.546
Come out!

00:09:39.307 --> 00:09:40.773
Come out!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.320
Dumb monster!

00:09:54.353 --> 00:09:55.767
Don't you know that's a mirror?

00:09:56.986 --> 00:09:57.653
Fuchsia...

00:10:00.307 --> 00:10:01.187
Fiery Fist...

00:10:03.217 --> 00:10:04.310
Heavenly Fire!

00:10:06.011 --> 00:10:07.011
Go to hell!

00:10:39.029 --> 00:10:39.920
That stench!

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:47.556
It's not dead yet?

00:10:48.489 --> 00:10:50.263
Mo Fan! They're going in!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.273
Run!

00:10:51.359 --> 00:10:53.079
Don't get killed by the Scaly Queen!

00:10:53.086 --> 00:10:53.953
Understood!

00:10:58.044 --> 00:10:58.898
Run?

00:10:58.899 --> 00:11:00.793
I would die if I do that.

00:11:01.219 --> 00:11:02.325
Book of Starchart.

00:11:02.742 --> 00:11:06.227
If my incantation speed is slower
than the monster's attack speed,

00:11:06.747 --> 00:11:08.339
I will die here.

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.050
It's all on this now.

00:11:16.622 --> 00:11:17.542
Shadow Nail!

00:11:33.662 --> 00:11:34.475
Lightning Bolt!

00:11:44.697 --> 00:11:45.821
Go to hell!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.273
It has finally ended.

00:12:11.564 --> 00:12:12.458
What are you doing?

00:12:15.555 --> 00:12:17.113
Okay! I understand!

00:12:17.501 --> 00:12:19.235
You want souls as evil as this too?

00:12:20.057 --> 00:12:21.798
Is this Spirit Essence?

00:12:22.848 --> 00:12:23.568
Oh yeah,

00:12:23.614 --> 00:12:25.680
the Scaly Queen is a
Warrior-level monster.

00:12:26.437 --> 00:12:27.170
Catfish.

00:12:27.397 --> 00:12:29.288
You don't want the
Spirit Essence, right?

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:32.195
I'll sell it on an auction.
I'm sure I can get profit from it!

00:12:46.261 --> 00:12:47.140
Go!

00:12:47.167 --> 00:12:49.198
Kill every single one of them!

00:12:49.407 --> 00:12:50.154
Yes!

00:12:52.711 --> 00:12:54.550
Where is the Scaly Queen?

00:12:55.724 --> 00:12:56.605
It's dead.

00:12:57.411 --> 00:12:58.291
Dead?

00:12:58.795 --> 00:13:00.168
No wonder you're the Hunter King.

00:13:00.215 --> 00:13:03.233
You managed to kill it
before our arrival.

00:13:03.765 --> 00:13:06.445
It's a shame we have to sacrifice
the infected students.

00:13:06.791 --> 00:13:07.925
They're still alive.

00:13:13.069 --> 00:13:15.194
Did that kid kill it?

00:13:20.687 --> 00:13:21.513
Go and save them.

00:13:21.925 --> 00:13:24.152
Don't let this be a traumatic
experience for them.

00:13:25.027 --> 00:13:25.613
Yes.

00:13:26.721 --> 00:13:27.387
Mo Fan!

00:13:27.716 --> 00:13:28.383
Mo Fan!

00:13:28.543 --> 00:13:30.049
Girl, I'm here.

00:13:34.834 --> 00:13:35.501
Mo Fan!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.794
You are bleeding a lot!

00:13:42.568 --> 00:13:43.448
Are you okay?

00:13:43.488 --> 00:13:45.761
Did you evacuate all the students
in the emergency room?

00:13:47.068 --> 00:13:47.788
Don't worry.

00:13:47.961 --> 00:13:49.438
They've been escorted out the stadium.

00:13:49.902 --> 00:13:52.374
I'm just worried about you.
That's why I'm here.

00:13:53.588 --> 00:13:54.294
What are you doing?

00:13:55.117 --> 00:13:56.936
Ling Ling, she's a healing mage.

00:13:58.147 --> 00:13:58.920
Let me have a look.

00:14:02.635 --> 00:14:04.675
Beautiful lady, will I be disfigured?

00:14:05.435 --> 00:14:06.142
You won't.

00:14:06.255 --> 00:14:08.482
This minor injury will be healed soon..

00:14:10.456 --> 00:14:11.603
I'll help the rest.

00:14:11.814 --> 00:14:12.801
Just stay here.

00:14:12.854 --> 00:14:14.195
I'll send someone to pick you up.

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:22.196
You're not dead yet?

00:14:22.237 --> 00:14:23.236
I'm impressed.

00:14:23.275 --> 00:14:24.651
Are you okay?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:25.907
Don't worry.

00:14:25.987 --> 00:14:27.777
I know how to deal with females.

00:14:28.094 --> 00:14:29.854
No matter if it's a woman
or a female monster.

00:14:31.485 --> 00:14:32.245
Okay then.

00:14:32.605 --> 00:14:33.579
You can take the credit now.

00:14:34.153 --> 00:14:35.741
Just remember to give me
my Soul Thunder Seed.

00:14:36.593 --> 00:14:37.855
I'll do just that.

00:14:39.513 --> 00:14:40.661
Mr. Li!

00:14:42.479 --> 00:14:44.065
But you're the one
that killed the Scaly Queen!

00:14:44.112 --> 00:14:45.172
Why does he get the credit?

00:14:45.978 --> 00:14:48.338
Don't you know that this is a big deal?

00:14:48.843 --> 00:14:51.123
You've saved many people
with your own power!

00:14:51.336 --> 00:14:53.153
You can get many benefits from this!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.592
My own improvement
is more important to me.

00:14:58.484 --> 00:15:00.992
I can't afford a Soul Thunder Seed.
It's too expensive.

00:15:02.438 --> 00:15:03.624
If I don't improve myself,

00:15:03.625 --> 00:15:06.389
I'm afraid I'll still be a loser for the
Hunters' Game in two years.

00:15:09.191 --> 00:15:09.964
Fine then.

00:15:10.391 --> 00:15:13.363
Are you sure you want to
enter the Hunters' Game?

00:15:14.489 --> 00:15:15.435
I must.

00:15:15.859 --> 00:15:17.245
And I must win it!

00:15:18.339 --> 00:15:21.761
The Hunters' Game will be filled
with extraordinary hunters.

00:15:22.488 --> 00:15:24.632
They're very experienced.

00:15:24.819 --> 00:15:26.153
And had participated in many battles.

00:15:27.084 --> 00:15:29.373
It's not easy to win the top prize.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.613
That's why...

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.674
I must improve myself
in the next two years.

00:15:33.775 --> 00:15:36.442
Are you joining it
because of the prizes?

00:15:36.973 --> 00:15:37.545
Yes.

00:15:37.625 --> 00:15:39.159
The main prize is a Winged Magic Tool.

00:15:40.678 --> 00:15:42.425
It is very expensive.

00:15:42.674 --> 00:15:45.527
But you don't need it now, do you?

00:15:45.681 --> 00:15:49.043
I think a Magic Armor is more practical.

00:15:49.596 --> 00:15:51.482
You don't have many Magic Tools as well.

00:15:53.851 --> 00:15:54.565
Never mind.

00:15:54.847 --> 00:15:56.513
I'll stop asking if you
don't feel like answering me.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.800
Everyone wants to be strong
for their own reason.

00:16:00.277 --> 00:16:01.477
You're unexpected.

00:16:10.724 --> 00:16:12.492
Monsters! There are monsters!

00:16:13.298 --> 00:16:14.183
It's okay now.

00:16:14.197 --> 00:16:15.140
Look.

00:16:20.837 --> 00:16:21.691
There are so many monsters!

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.016
Who saved us then?

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:29.013
I think it's the Bounty Hunters.

00:16:38.841 --> 00:16:39.654
Yeah.

00:16:39.943 --> 00:16:41.770
Everyone wants to be strong
for their own reason.

00:16:42.122 --> 00:16:43.962
And the reasons are simple too.

00:16:44.779 --> 00:16:46.226
I have an angel in my heart.

00:16:46.687 --> 00:16:48.033
I can't let her down.

00:16:56.296 --> 00:17:00.100
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:17:00.101 --> 00:17:03.328
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:17:03.354 --> 00:17:06.332
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:06.345 --> 00:17:08.922
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:13.595 --> 00:17:15.850
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:15.851 --> 00:17:17.911
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.065
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:23.333
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:17:23.823 --> 00:17:27.006
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:17:27.007 --> 00:17:28.601
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:17:28.628 --> 00:17:31.268
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:17:31.269 --> 00:17:33.546
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:17:33.567 --> 00:17:36.260
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:17:36.287 --> 00:17:39.592
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:41.641
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:17:41.685 --> 00:17:43.074
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:17:43.075 --> 00:17:45.189
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:17:45.913 --> 00:17:47.083
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:17:47.084 --> 00:17:49.359
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.292
♪ As we meet ♪

00:17:50.293 --> 00:17:52.398
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:17:52.399 --> 00:17:53.899
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:17:53.935 --> 00:17:57.398
♪ Every drop of sweat remembers
how you have tried ♪

00:17:57.441 --> 00:17:59.192
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:17:59.193 --> 00:18:01.113
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:18:01.114 --> 00:18:03.294
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:18:03.315 --> 00:18:04.619
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:07.967
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:07.968 --> 00:18:10.897
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:10.898 --> 00:18:14.364
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:15.999
♪ Oh ♪

00:18:16.626 --> 00:18:20.268
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
